    "title": "GPS Location — Verification",
    "author": "ASAPS QA",
    "description": "Manual verification story for the Set GPS Location beat (capture/explicit/scatter/preset), walkable placement (OSM), and the GpsLocation pointName geofence binding. Runs with Mock Sensors on desktop; Test C needs internet.",
